.TH "AtExitClean" "3" "2026\-09\-29" "TheCRatTime" "AtExit reference"
.SH NAME
\fBAtExitClean\fR \- clean \fBAtExitHeader\fR struct.\&
.PP
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fB#include\fR <\fBatexit.\&h\fR>
.PP
\fBvoid AtExitClean(AtExitHeader* \fIhead\fB);\fR
.PP
.SH DESCRIPTION
Clean all functions, that was set by \fBSetAtExit\fR(3).\&
.PP
\fIhead\fR
.RS 4
Pointer to \fBAtExitHeader\fR.\&
.RE
.PP
.SH EXAMPLES
There is no examples.\&
.PP
.SH NOTES
Don't do it if you have set \fBfree\fR(3) function because you can get double free or memory leak.\&
.PP
.SH AUTHORS
Project and man\-page: TheCRatTime
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBatexit_do\fR(3), \fBInitAtExit\fR(3), \fBSetAtExit\fR(3), \fBAtExitHeader\fR(3type)
